# Defensive: this repo ships ONLY .py and .sh under public/ and private/.
# Ignore everything, then un-ignore the two source dirs and the two extensions.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!public/
!private/
public/**
private/**
!public/**/*.py
!public/**/*.sh
!private/**/*.py
!private/**/*.sh
# Never, under any circumstance:
*.json
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc
